        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek AP-87001, Urban Modern Freestone Appliance Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Freestone Appliance Pull is available in 12 inch and 18 inch center to center lengths. Its modern appearance comes from the square grip. This bar pull comes packaged with the necessary mounting hardware to install it on a refrigerator door. Choose from several contemporary finishes for this Urban Modern Freestone Appliance Pull.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n\r\n<tr class=\"text\">\r\n<td>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Freestone Refrigerator Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-87001-specifications.pdf?v=1704262368\"><b>Emtek Freestone Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-87001:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 14\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 11/16\" square</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-87002:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 20\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 11/16\" square</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n\r\n<td>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Also Available:</b>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/freestone-cabinet-pull-emtek-86453\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86455.jpg?v=1704354712\"  width=\"218\" height=\"90\" alt=\"EMT-86453\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<a href=\"/products/freestone-cabinet-pull-emtek-86453\"><b>Freestone Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?